Name: sasl_log_level
Type: INT
Default-Value: 1
Last-Modified: UNRELEASED
For-Documentation-Only: 1
SASL-Option: log_level

Specify how verbosely SASL operations should log:

0 (SASL_LOG_NONE)
  don't log anything
1 (SASL_LOG_ERR)
  log unusual errors (default)
2 (SASL_LOG_FAIL)
  log all authentication failures
3 (SASL_LOG_WARN)
  log non-fatal warnings
4 (SASL_LOG_NOTE)
  more verbose than LOG_WARN
5 (SASL_LOG_DEBUG)
  more verbose than LOG_NOTE
6 (SASL_LOG_TRACE)
  traces of internal protocols
7 (SASL_LOG_PASS)
  traces of internal protocols, including passwords
